<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S&amp;S Hold half yr shr, div steady.</title>
<headline>S&amp;S Hold half yr shr, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Oct 31, 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     17.0	vs  16.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  4.5	vs   4.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    8.66     vs   8.35</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   24.43     vs  21.41</p>
<p>    Tax			  6.11     vs   5.57</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    8.64     vs   7.74</p>
<p>    Turnover		 823.82     vs 820.89</p>
<p>Div payable Feb 28</p>
<p>on register Feb 14</p>
<p>Full name: Stocks &amp; Stocks Holdings Ltd (industrial -</p>
<p>building &amp; construction)</p>
<p>Note: The company holds a 65 percent interest in Stocks &amp; Stocks Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
